{"title": "Polearm Master: Opportunity Attack", "pageid": 22756, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Polearm_Master:_Opportunity_Attack", "categories": ["Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Polearm_Master_Opportunity_Attack.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Polearm_Master_Opportunity_Attack.webp/300px-Polearm_Master_Opportunity_Attack.webp, /w/images/9/98/Polearm_Master_Opportunity_Attack.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Polearm_Master_Opportunity_Attack.webp/300px-Polearm_Master_Opportunity_Attack.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/98/Polearm_Master_Opportunity_Attack.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Polearm Master: Opportunity Attack</b> is a passive feature provided by the <a href=\"/wiki/Polearm_Master\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Polearm Master\">Polearm Master</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Feat\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Feat\">Feat</a>. When an enemy approaches your melee range, you can spend a <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/35px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/46px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Reactions\" title=\"Actions\">Reaction</a> to make an attack.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When wielding a glaive, halberd, quarterstaff, or spear, you can make an <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Opportunity_Attack\" title=\"Opportunity Attack\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp/25px-Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp/38px-Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp/50px-Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Opportunity Attack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp/25px-Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/35/Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Opportunity_Attack\" title=\"Opportunity Attack\">Opportunity Attack</a> when a target comes within range. \n</p><p>Prerequisite: Must be wielding a glaive, halberd, quarterstaff, or spear.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the feats:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Polearm_Master\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Polearm Master\">Polearm Master</a>\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Cannot be triggered by moving forcibly an enemy into the range, for example, by shoving.</li>\n<li>Unlike the regular <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Opportunity_Attack\" title=\"Opportunity Attack\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp/25px-Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp/38px-Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp/50px-Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Opportunity Attack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp/25px-Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/35/Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Opportunity_Attack\" title=\"Opportunity Attack\">Opportunity Attack</a>, this feature is able to be used while under the protection of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sanctuary\" title=\"Sanctuary\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Sanctuary_Icon.webp/25px-Sanctuary_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Sanctuary_Icon.webp/38px-Sanctuary_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Sanctuary_Icon.webp/50px-Sanctuary_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sanctuary\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Sanctuary_Icon.webp/25px-Sanctuary_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Sanctuary_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sanctuary\" title=\"Sanctuary\">Sanctuary</a> but will immediately break the effect.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>This feature is still able to attack targets that have either <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Panache\" title=\"Panache\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a4/Panache_Icon.webp/25px-Panache_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a4/Panache_Icon.webp/38px-Panache_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a4/Panache_Icon.webp/50px-Panache_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Panache\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a4/Panache_Icon.webp/25px-Panache_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a4/Panache_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Panache\" title=\"Panache\">Panache</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fancy_Footwork\" title=\"Fancy Footwork\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Fancy_Footwork_Icon.webp/25px-Fancy_Footwork_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Fancy_Footwork_Icon.webp/38px-Fancy_Footwork_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Fancy_Footwork_Icon.webp/50px-Fancy_Footwork_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fancy Footwork\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Fancy_Footwork_Icon.webp/25px-Fancy_Footwork_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Fancy_Footwork_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fancy_Footwork\" title=\"Fancy Footwork\">Fancy Footwork</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200103\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.044 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.049 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1580/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 11165/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6578/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 19/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion dept